                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Professor Kim is truly incredible. She is clearly very passionate about what she teaches. She does a really great job of keeping students engaged with some tough material. She is also very accomodating and understanding. If you need an extension or extra help she does a really good job of giving one on one feedback. ",
